      "content": "The resentment you perceive is likely rooted in their own exhaustion, not a true reflection of their love for you. When you are this unwell, it makes it impossible to see the genuine affection that is still there. Please understand that choosing to end things is a permanent solution to a temporary, though agonizing, state of mind. Let's focus on finding a way to ease the weight you are carrying right now, because you deserve relief.",
